<title>NETHERLANDS: NPM 1996 OPERATIONAL NET UP 4.6 PCT.</title>
<headline>NPM 1996 OPERATIONAL NET UP 4.6 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Operational net/shr (guilders)   2.78 vs   2.75</p>
<p>    Operational net profit	    70.4  vs  67.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  2.80 vs   2.75</p>
<p>    Costs				    7.8  vs   7.1</p>
<p>    Tax					0.6  vs   1.2</p>
<p>    Net capital gains on holdings   81.2  vs  27.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Venture capital firm Nederlandse Participatie</p>
<p>Maatschappij NV previously said it expected slightly higher 1996</p>
<p>operational profits.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
